  "description": "High-performance, CPU-only .NET 8 & 10 PII redaction, data masking, anonymization, and reversible AES-256-GCM tokenization library for nested JSON, NDJSON, and POCOs. Detects and masks Credit Cards (Luhn), PAN, Aadhaar (Verhoeff), GSTIN, UPI, IFSC, SSN, IBAN, Email, Phone, DOB, and IPv4/IPv6 for PCI-DSS, GDPR, HIPAA, and DPDP compliance with zero GPU and built-in CPU concurrency limits.",
