  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0: CPU-only zero-copy UTF-8 JSON/NDJSON streaming, real Indian/Global statutory checksums (Luhn+IIN, Verhoeff, GSTIN Mod-36, IBAN Mod-97), AES-256-GCM key-ring rotation, HMAC-SHA256 hashing, server CPU usage caps (WithMaxCpuUsage), one-line factories, pure-.NET ONNX multilingual NER downloader, and verified .NET 8 and .NET 10 parity.",
